    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Cognigy Functions — Deprecation Tracker\n\nCognigy Functions is being deprecated. This dashboard tracks which customers are still using it so we can contact them and safely disable the feature.\n\n**How to use:**\n- **Active Orgs** = customers still to migrate. Goal: reach 0.\n- **Cluster table** = once a cluster shows 0 executions, it is safe to disable Functions there.\n- **Org+cluster table** = the hit-list. Export weekly via panel menu → **Inspect → Data → Download CSV**.\n\n> ⚠️ To resolve an `organisationId` to a customer name: open the **AI / Agents Overview** dashboard → **Organisations** panel → select the cluster → filter by ID.\n\n_Default time range: last 7 days. Data aggregated across all clusters via Thanos._",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.0.2",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "description": "Number of distinct organisations that have executed at least one Cognigy Function in the selected time range. Goal: reach 0.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.0.2",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$datasource"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": false,
          "expr": "count(\n  sum by (organisationId) (\n    increase(cognigy_function_scheduler_scheduled_functions_count[$__range])\n  ) > 0\n)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active Orgs in Timespan",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
